<title>USA: U.S. stocks open higher.</title>
<headline>U.S. stocks open higher.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wall Street stocks opened firmer on Wednesday in a follow through to Tuesday's rally, with strength in some high-technology stocks sending the Nasdaq index higher, dealers said.</p>
<p>Strong bonds also gave stocks a boost in early trade.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones industrials average was up nine at 6,317, the Nasdaq Composite up nine at 1,276 and the S&amp;P Index up two at 728.</p>
<p>The 30-year bond was 13/32 higher to yield 6.63 percent.</p>
</text>
